"kaynak": "firma https://www.hitachienergy.com/news-and-events/press-releases/2026/06/tr-hitachi-energy-inaugurates-power-transformers-factory-and-service-center-in-dilovas-turkiye ; haber https://elektrikdunyasi.com.tr/haber/kuresel-transformator-acigi-buyuyor-europower-world-uretime-100-siparisle-basladi/ ; firma https://kap.org.tr/en/api/file/download/4028328d9f52dddc01a08147e1281499",
"kime": "Europower yatırımcı ilişkileri."
