"kaynak": "diger https://www.karekod.org/blog/kum-fiyatlari/ ; haber https://www.evrensel.net/haber/5992540/sit-alanindaki-kum-cakil-ocagi-ruhsati-iptal-edildi-arkeolojik-sit-alanina-iliskin-gorus-alinmadi ; haber https://www.businessday.co.za/companies/2026-03-31-illegal-sand-mining-raises-pressure-on-sa-construction-supply-chains/",
